    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d784">

                <pb facs="0986" n="976" xml:id="pg976"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.00/9–447: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Tsingtao</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Spiker</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tsingtao</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-09-04T09:00:00+09:00">September 4,
                            1947—9 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 1:28 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>75. Reference Embassy telegram 74, repeated Dept 1851, September 3, 4 p.m., which
                    indicates Embassy may not have received my messages 98 and 99 (71<anchor n="66"
                        xml:id="d784-f1"/> and 72 to Dept) dated September 21 [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">2</hi>], 1 [<hi rendition="#italic">11</hi>] a.m., and 3
                    p.m., respectively, reporting Navy in friendly contact with Communists near
                    Goose Point. Negotiations have been continuing and ComNavWesPac today proceeding
                    there by flying boat obtain firsthand information. He desired Service accompany
                    him and, in view present contact established, desirability for close cooperation
                    with Admiral, and for our firsthand information assist in possible further
                    negotiations by Consulate with Communists, have sent Service to act in purely
                    consultative capacity and not to enter negotiations. He will return with Admiral
                    today and report will be made Embassy and sent Dept.</p>
                <p>Sent 100 to Embassy, repeated 75 to Dept.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Spiker</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
